   "summary": "Korea's exports more than doubled during the first 20 days of November, customs data showed Monday.",
   "summary_zh": "周一公布的海关数据显示，韩国出口额在11月前20天增长了一倍以上。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Korea's exports more than doubled during the first 20 days of November, customs data showed Monday. Outbound shipments reached $77.4 billion in the Nov. 1-20 period, up from $38.4 billion a year ago, according to the data from the Korea Customs Service. Imports went up 39.4 percent on-year to $50.3 billion over the cited period, resulting in a trade surplus of $27.1 billion",
