   "title": "Ruling party outlines grounds to impeach chief justice",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/politics/20261122/ruling-party-outlines-grounds-to-impeach-chief-justice",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
